{
  "id": "color-constancy",
  "term": "color constancy",
  "definition": "Color constancy is the ability to see an object’s surface color as relatively stable even when the lighting changes and alters the light reaching the eye. This perceptual stability helps support consistent recognition and memory for objects across different viewing conditions.",
